        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.276,
            0.618,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": "2. Simplify each of the following expressions:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.301,
            0.763,
            0.321
          ],
          "content": "(a) $p + p + p + p , p + p + p + q ,$ (b) p + q + p – q,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.325,
            0.764,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "(c) p – q + p – q, (d) p + q – p + q,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.349,
            0.76,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "(e) p + q – (p + q), (f) p – q – p – q"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.372,
            0.773,
            0.392
          ],
          "content": "(g) 2d – d – d – d, (h) 2d – d – d – c,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.396,
            0.786,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "(i) 2d – d – (d – c), (j) $2d - (d - d) = c,$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.42,
            0.382,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": "(k) $2 d - d - c - c$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.459,
            0.6,
            0.48
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Mind the Mistake, Mend the Mistake"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.49,
            0.847,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": "Some simplifications of algebraic expressions are done below. The expression on the right-hand side should be in its simplest form."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.533,
            0.706,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": "• Observe each of them and see if there is a mistake."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.557,
            0.847,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": "If you think there is a mistake, try to explain what might have gone wrong."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.599,
            0.468,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": "• Then, simplify it correctly."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.624,
            0.337,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": "**Expression**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.624,
            0.59,
            0.644
          ],
          "content": "**Simplest Form**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.642,
            0.624,
            0.825,
            0.66
          ],
          "content": "**Correct Simplest Form**"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.666,
            0.322,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": "1. $3 a + 2 b$",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_26.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.69,
            0.353,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": "2. $3 b - 2 b - b$",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_27.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.714,
            0.33,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "3. 6 (p + 2)",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_28.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.456,
            0.715,
            0.52,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": "6 p + 8",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_29.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.738,
            0.436,
            0.758
          ],
          "content": "4.\\quad (4x + 3y) - (3x + 4y)",
          "image_source": "images/page_13_equation_30.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
